# Wave T27 (Mistford kit): shackroof — Mistford's own roof kind.
# Weathered surf-teal WOOD SHAKES: irregular vertical splits, bleached
# streaks, a driftwood ridge along the top. In the KIT_VARIANTS dewford
# roof tones (#4fa3a5/#2f6e70/#79c2c0). Structurally shake + ridge, not
# a recolour: Meadowbrook wears small staggered sage stone shingles,
# Copperton wide slabs with copper seams, Eldergrove banded thatch,
# Rootlet flat cedar shingle; shakes read as surf-shack timber at
# screenshot scale. (NO-SAME-KIT law.)
